flowchart TD
    A([Start: daily close]) --> B[Export POS sales and returns]
    B --> C[Export ERP inventory and open POs]
    C --> D[Clean and combine spreadsheets]
    D --> E{More SKU/store rows?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Calculate expected on-hand]
    F --> G{Expected equals ERP?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Mark reconciled]
    G -- No --> I[Investigate duplicates, receipts, and cutoffs]
    I --> J{Evidence supports adjustment?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Enter ERP adjustment]
    J -- No --> L[Escalate for supervisor review]
    K --> M{At or below reorder point?}
    H --> M
    L --> E
    M -- Yes --> N[Prepare replenishment request]
    M -- No --> E
    N --> E
    E -- No --> O[Save evidence and email summary]
    O --> P([End])
